==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,500%) spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,500%) spawn, delay 50~100 seconds<sup>1,500f~3,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Teacher Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is completely trivialized by the Curse Immunity talent on [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]. If you have it, you should have no trouble stalling the enemies here. After that, just pack in some anti-floating units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]] to finish the job.

Otherwise you'll want to wanna bring backline damagers like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat) |Awakened Ururun]] or [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat) |Awakened Mina]] along with four meatshields to prevent heavy pushing.

